{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"That news brings me hope..... If one can survive here.... we all can\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:28:35.448000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739973017676939364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"Yes, it is possible... but I would be concerned how the native peoples are reacting to all of this.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:29:39.705000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739973287190331443","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"nods, listening","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:30:08.396000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T22:30:14.234000Z","id":"739973407529107618","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"I don't want to come off as rude.. but why are you here with these colonists? I've met a few of your kind when I first came to this place. Why are you not with them?\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:31:14.804000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739973686064447488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"smiles a broad smile \"This is not where my school is from.... my school is\" thinks for a moment \"gone.... I am looking for a new home.... and where better to serve than to bridge two worlds?\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:32:45.057000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739974064612835468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"Ah I see. So you are planning to be a diplomat of sorts between the people here.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:33:52.701000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739974348332335195","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"That is my hope.... I have lived in both worlds.... and I want peace..\" thinks for a moment \"I dont want the Nations here to war with the Countries there.... So why not... invest myself into\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:35:30.627000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739974759063748628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"She nods. \"I met Sir Rigatony last night, he mentioned that you all needed more people to build relationships between the colonists and natives.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:37:02.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739975144289861642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"I figured I could be of use since I've met some of the native people and I speak Woodland  Arcanian.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:38:08.580000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739975421566910515","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
